ents for those fields—likely validation and error handling rather than just the basic behavior that's already in place.\n\nThe key insight is that the task title mentions \"validation and error reporting,\" so I should add a `validateDiffTest` function that checks required fields like Name and provides clear error messages. I'll call this validation from `runSubtest` before execution to catch issues early, though R1.2 through R1.4 themselves don't require strict validation since nil and empty values are semantically valid. the task scope is R1.2 through R1.4, and while the core behavior seems already implemented, I should focus on what could actually be missing—maybe adding validation checks for environment variable format or better documentation around these semantics rather than assuming the work is already done. Writing validation function...","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4519,"cache_read_input_tokens":68619,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4519},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4d61a695-a762-472b-b465-2fb2156c56a1","uuid":"93621aaf-1d71-4292-ae7b-4628f2008487"}
